    "detailed_description": "Meteora's Mystic Merge is a puzzle game based on the famous Suika game. Instead of fruits it uses a variety of vtubers as assets. Meteora's Mystic Merge features currently only a new game mode with a playable character (namely Meteora) who has a special ability, and a classic mode coming soon which plays a lot like the original though with some changes.<br><br>This game is similar to the cult game &quot;2048&quot; as well as &quot;Suika Game&quot; which is a switch exclusive. It does seem easy on the surface but difficulty rises with progression into the game...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2>Combine two of the same character/object to get to the next one. Combining orbs charges the chararacter's ability which helps you to progress further.<br>Try to get to the final Meteora without exceeding the glass or throwing any objects outside of it.<br>On the right side you can see a little graph which explains the progression levels.<br>Though the first ones seem rather easy, getting to the final Meteora is challenging to say the least...<br><br>By playing games you earn MeteCoins which you can use to roll in the build in Gacha to unlock skins and other playable characters.<br>Can you reach the final orb on them all?<br><br>Do you prefer to unlock it all or try to get a high leaderboard ranking?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits:</h2>Art by Rune<br>Gravity++ by Excelsus",
    "about_the_game": "Meteora's Mystic Merge is a puzzle game based on the famous Suika game. Instead of fruits it uses a variety of vtubers as assets. Meteora's Mystic Merge features currently only a new game mode with a playable character (namely Meteora) who has a special ability, and a classic mode coming soon which plays a lot like the original though with some changes.<br><br>This game is similar to the cult game &quot;2048&quot; as well as &quot;Suika Game&quot; which is a switch exclusive. It does seem easy on the surface but difficulty rises with progression into the game...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2>Combine two of the same character/object to get to the next one. Combining orbs charges the chararacter's ability which helps you to progress further.<br>Try to get to the final Meteora without exceeding the glass or throwing any objects outside of it.<br>On the right side you can see a little graph which explains the progression levels.<br>Though the first ones seem rather easy, getting to the final Meteora is challenging to say the least...<br><br>By playing games you earn MeteCoins which you can use to roll in the build in Gacha to unlock skins and other playable characters.<br>Can you reach the final orb on them all?<br><br>Do you prefer to unlock it all or try to get a high leaderboard ranking?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits:</h2>Art by Rune<br>Gravity++ by Excelsus",
    "short_description": "Meteora's Mystic Merge is a puzzle game based on the famous Suika game but with abilities added on top. Instead of fruits it uses a variety of vtubers as assets. Combine two characters to slowly get to the final one.",
